<title>SPAIN: Salomon to advise Spain's SEPI on Potasas sale.</title>
<headline>Salomon to advise Spain's SEPI on Potasas sale.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers has been named advisor to Spanish state holding company SEPI for the privatisation of potash mining group Potasas, the brokerage said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Potasas, which is to be fully privatised, posted consolidated net profit of 2.2 billion pesetas in 1995 on turnover of 22 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
